sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    participant UI as Naseej UI
    participant API as Naseej API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Clinician

    Patient->>UI: Choose Prepare visit
    UI->>API: Request draft from patient record
    API->>DB: Load entries, symptoms and linked documents
    DB-->>API: Patient-owned records
    API-->>UI: Draft summary with source references
    Patient->>UI: Edit, select documents and approve
    UI->>API: Save approved preparation
    API->>DB: Store visit_prep (approved)
    DB-->>API: Saved
    API-->>UI: Approval confirmation
    Patient->>UI: Choose expiry and confirm share
    UI->>API: Create share request
    Note right of API: Verify ownership,<br/>approval, expiry
    API->>DB: Store snapshot, token hash and document grants
    DB-->>API: Share created
    Note over API,DB: Raw token is never stored
    API-->>UI: One-time share URL for QR
    Note over Patient,Clinician: Patient shows the QR or link
    Clinician->>API: Open share token
    API->>DB: Find share, check expiry and revocation
    DB-->>API: Share status
    alt Share is valid
        API->>DB: Record access event
        API-->>Clinician: Read-only snapshot
        opt Document
            Clinician->>API: Request document
            API->>DB: Verify grant and validity, record event
            API-->>Clinician: Document bytes
        end
    else Expired or revoked
        API-->>Clinician: Access denied
    end
    Patient->>UI: Revoke share
    UI->>API: Revoke request
    API->>DB: Set revoked_at
    DB-->>API: Updated share
